interface.longDescription:
DenchikP CDN is a file storage and content delivery service for websites, apps and screenshots. This app connects ChatGPT to your DenchikP CDN account.

What it can do:
- show your plan, quotas, usage and the domains you can upload to;
- find files by name, folder or extension and show their links, sizes and dates;
- read text files (html, css, js, json, md) and look at images (jpg, png, webp, gif);
- upload new files from text, base64 or a public link, or several text files at once, for example a whole web page;
- build links to resized or converted images (webp, avif) and temporary signed links;
- create password-protected share links with an expiry and a download limit;
- show usage statistics, expiring files, the trash, duplicates, checksums and antivirus results.

What it cannot do: delete, overwrite, rename or change existing files. If a file name is taken, the upload is rejected.

You sign in once with your DenchikP CDN API key on our consent page. The key is not stored; ChatGPT gets its own token with read, upload and share permissions, which you can revoke at any time in the DenchikP CDN panel.
